      "full_chain_observation": "实际AdventureEvents注册→原生LivingIncomingDamage LOW先应用entity attachment reductions，随后所有EquipmentSlot逐个gems+affixes→AffixHelper读取真实AFFIXES/RARITY组件并验证bound/canApplyTo→AffixInstance派发DamageReductionAffix完整onHurt；实际datagen六种装备词缀定义值范围和类目→source既非BYPASS_INVULNERABILITY亦非BYPASS_ENCHANTMENTS且匹配type才amount*(1-level)，else基类原样返回。",
      "concrete_observation": "一个装备词缀来源匹配减伤门1，不把physical/magic/explosion/fall/projectile/lightning或稀有度变体拆数。默认生成值都<1，复合乘法仍不构成Boss拒控，不能以说明tooltip灰色误当受击灰字。外部physical predicate/StepFunction和CachedObjectSource内部不在本条独立计数；reload注释说明cached可能unbound，native onDamage用getAffixes.values没有streamAffixes额外isValid过滤，不保证所有reload顺序安全。没有取消事件/明确拒控或声光S2C。datagen定义是实际Java配置，未取得原始生成JSON/启动证明，不冒称运行已载入。",
